# Character Sheet: {{.Name}}

**{{.Race}} {{.Class}} Level {{.Level}}**  
**Background:** {{.Background}} | **Alignment:** {{.Alignment}}  
**Player:** {{.PlayerName}}

---

## Statistics

| STR | DEX | CON | INT | WIS | CHA |
|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|
| {{.Stats.STR}} (+{{printf "%d" (index (slice (add .Stats.STR 10) 2)}}) | {{.Stats.DEX}} (+{{printf "%d" (index (slice (add .Stats.DEX 10) 2)}}) | {{.Stats.CON}} (+{{printf "%d" (index (slice (add .Stats.CON 10) 2)}}) | {{.Stats.INT}} (+{{printf "%d" (index (slice (add .Stats.INT 10) 2)}}) | {{.Stats.WIS}} (+{{printf "%d" (index (slice (add .Stats.WIS 10) 2)}}) | {{.Stats.CHA}} (+{{printf "%d" (index (slice (add .Stats.CHA 10) 2)}}) |

**HP:** {{.HP.Current}}/{{.HP.Maximum}} | **AC:** {{.AC}} | **Proficiency Bonus:** +{{.Proficiency}}

---

## Skills and Proficiencies

<div class="session-prep-card">
<h3>Skills</h3>
{{range $skill, $proficient := .Skills}}
{{if $proficient}}
<div class="prep-item">✓ {{ $skill }}</div>
{{end}}
{{end}}
</div>

---

## Class and Racial Features

{{if .Features}}
{{range .Features}}
<div class="session-prep-card">
<div class="prep-item"><strong>{{.Name}}</strong> ({{.Source}})</div>
</div>
{{end}}
{{end}}

---

## Inventory

{{if .Inventory}}
<div class="session-prep-card">
<h3>Inventory</h3>
{{range .Inventory}}
<div class="prep-item">• {{.Name}} {{if .Quantity}}(x{{.Quantity}}){{end}} {{if .Type}}[{{.Type}}]{{end}}</div>
{{end}}
</div>
{{end}}

---

## Spells

{{if .Spells}}
{{range $spell := .Spells}}
<div class="encounter-recommendation">
{{if eq $spell.Level 0}}
<span class="cr-badge">Cantrip</span>
{{else}}
<span class="cr-badge">Level {{$spell.Level}}</span>
{{end}}
<strong>{{$spell.Name}}</strong> {{if $spell.Prepared}}(Prepared){{end}}
{{if $spell.School}}<br><em>{{$spell.School}}</em>{{end}}
</div>
{{end}}
{{end}}

---

## Backstory

{{if .Personality.Backstory}}
<div class="character-worksheet">
<div class="worksheet-section">
<h4>Personal History</h4>
<p>{{.Personality.Backstory}}</p>
</div>
</div>
{{end}}

{{if .BackstoryHooks}}
<div class="character-worksheet">
<div class="worksheet-section">
<h4>Backstory Hooks</h4>
{{range .BackstoryHooks}}
<div class="prompt-box">• {{.}}</div>
{{end}}
</div>
</div>
{{end}}

---

